# Opens Settings from the launcher's home screen (docs/snapshot.md, S2): a swipe up opens the all-apps drawer, then a tap on
# the Settings icon at display (205, 201), where B18's runs found it (docs/boot.md, B18: bnds=[141,131][270,311]).
# "ms dev type code value" from the first open of a device, or, after --restore, from the restore (engine/evdev.c).
# dev 0 is the touchscreen: ABS_MT_SLOT 47, ABS_MT_TRACKING_ID 57, ABS_MT_POSITION_X 53, _Y 54, ABS_MT_PRESSURE 58,
# BTN_TOUCH 330, SYN_REPORT 0 0 0 (the events web/input.js sends for a pointer).
